# Scopes the Docker build context of scripts/smoke-homebrew-docker.sh, the only Docker build
# that uses this repo root as its context. Allow list: ignore everything, then re-include each
# COPY source of that script's Dockerfile. Every COPY source must be listed here (guarded by
# tests/homebrew-smoke-docker.test.ts). This keeps node_modules, .git and dotenv files off the
# Docker daemon.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!tsup.config.ts
!src
!shell
!scripts/docker-homebrew-smoke-runner.sh
